<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Boosting Embodied AI Agents through Perception-Generation Disaggregation and Asynchronous Pipeline Execution</h1>
<span class="ltx_pubnotes ltx_pubnotes_meta"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_submissionid">&lt;640&gt;</span></span></span>
